    "summary": {
      "es": "This command generates a signature from a block of data by using a private key (RSA, ECC).\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command supports Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) keys. You must enable the PQC license to use these keys.\n- Signing and verifying PQC-generated signatures is currently disabled in PCI HSM mode pending PCI approval.\n- You can use SHA3 and SHAKE hashing algorithms in FIPS mode in FW version 7.6.1.10 and later.",
      "en": "This command generates a signature from a block of data by using a private key (RSA, ECC).\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command supports Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) keys. You must enable the PQC license to use these keys.\n- Signing and verifying PQC-generated signatures is currently disabled in PCI HSM mode pending PCI approval.\n- You can use SHA3 and SHAKE hashing algorithms in FIPS mode in FW version 7.6.1.10 and later."
    },
