      "en": "This command establishes a secure session with a chip card SCP02.\n\n`Available in firmware version 7.6.1.28 and later.`\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command functions identically to the International command **IC**."
