      "en": "# CKTA: Clear Key Table\n\nFuente: [CKTA: Clear Key Table](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/keys/key_tables/ckta-clear-key-table)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:01:10.193Z\n\n---\n\nThis command erases all key table locations in an Excrypt board, including Diebold entries and not including the MFK and KEK registers.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"required-permissions\"></a>\n\n## Required permissions\n\n| Permissions | Description | Port | Min Logins |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Keys | View key and table information | Mgmt | 0 |\n| Management Commands:Keys | Give permission over key-related commands on the administrative port. | Mgmt | 1 |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `CKTA` |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `CKTA` |\n\n<a id=\"bb-indicator-that-all-tables-have-been-cleared\"></a>\n\n### BB - Indicator that all tables have been cleared\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 | Alphabetic | `OK` |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command example\n\n```\nRequest: [AOCKTA;]\n\nResponse: [AOCKTA;BBOK;]\n```\n"
