      "es": "Creates a random decimal or hexadecimal number up to 48 digits in length.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n**Note**\n\n- If the **AP** token designates a decimal number, a decimal number must be entered for the minimum and maximum.\n- If the **AP** token designates a hexadecimal number, a hexadecimal number must be entered for the minimum and maximum.\n- Hexadecimal numbers must have even number of digits. If an odd number of digits is provided, you can add a leading zero.",
