      "es": "This command decrypts an Apple Tap to Pay token. Before it decrypts the token, it verifies the signature in the PKCS7, obtains the session key, and then decrypts the token.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Apple documentation states that the user should verify that the certificate is not revoked (CRL). This verification is not part of this command.\n- If the HSM is in Secure Mode, Pay Token Configuration is not allowed and is disabled.\n- Support for Apple Tap to Pay Proximity Payment Service API version 2 in FW version 7.6.1.10 and later.",
