      "es": "This command verifies the incoming message code (MAC) from incoming Visa DUKPT current transaction data, following that, generates verification or rejection MAC.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- The generated MACs are called Code 1, Code 2, and Code 3.  \n\n  - Code 1 verifies the incoming MAC.\n  - Code 2 and Code 3 verifies or rejects MACs.",
