    "summary": {
      "es": "This command can detokenize and encrypt cardholder data using a DUKPT derived key.\n\n**Available in Firmware version 7.6.1.27 and later.**\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Accepts a token of a PAN encrypted with FPE3.1 and de-tokenizes it\n- Encrypts the de-tokenized PAN under a DUKPT derived key\n- HMAC/PBKDF2’s the input tokenized PAN",
      "en": "This command can detokenize and encrypt cardholder data using a DUKPT derived key.\n\n**Available in Firmware version 7.6.1.27 and later.**\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Accepts a token of a PAN encrypted with FPE3.1 and de-tokenizes it\n- Encrypts the de-tokenized PAN under a DUKPT derived key\n- HMAC/PBKDF2’s the input tokenized PAN"
    },
