      "es": "This command encrypts cardholder data (PAN) using a DUKPT-derived key.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- We require you to sign a waiver to enable PIN variant mode. We strongly recommend using PIN variant mode in an isolated and segregated HSM environment with appropriate controls in place.\n- The PIN variant is only available with the CPIN feature enabled and is only allowed in PCI mode for issuing environments.\n- For more information about DUKPT, see ANSI x9.24, Part 1 - Annex A.",
