      "es": "# EMSD: Sign EMV data\n\nFuente: [EMSD: Sign EMV data](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/payments_cards/emv/acquiring/emsd-sign-emv-data)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:02:34.342Z\n\n---\n\n**Available in FW 7.6.1.4 and later**\n\nThis command signs EMV data.\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| EMV Acquiring | Enables the Europay Mastercard Visa (EMV) acquiring command set. |\n| RSA | Enables commands requiring RSA functionality. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | **﻿**`EMSD` |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-used-for-asymmetric-key\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major key used for asymmetric key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK (default)<br>`6`: PMK<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"rc-encrypted-private-key-used-to-generate-the-signature\"></a>\n\n### RC - Encrypted Private Key used to generate the signature\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"bo-hex-encoded-data-used-to-generate-the-signature\"></a>\n\n### BO - Hex encoded data used to generate the signature\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-8192 | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `EMSD` |\n\n<a id=\"rh-hex-encoded-signature-generated\"></a>\n\n### RH - Hex Encoded Signature Generated\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command example\n\n```\nRequest:[AOEMSD;BO6AF4E28FE3F0374C1EC4B971969815299A573CCA2D5B84CADDFBC72339FB24E429CC0A1C73711AA87BB4841BC50FB7981691E22BB78AAC12EB0E7769AE2F9AA4C7E6B42E03D79D731CA6FB159C255A118A53A1DB4049BD992BCEA06BD79163B041511603B5321FE2D166EAE0FB1FF5F722803BA4E69BD5D16666BF50020720BC;FS6;;] &#x9;\n\nResponse:[AOEMSD;RH30D7990BA9840316FDBD75C640548F397C74E65FDA29A4B98448B204A826153BF186AEC1EA7C107823FAC4F92FFC4F1A58EFCE5BF6F369E1671AC6C2F8BEEA050267CF9B04723A11AAE0F201E6C438D42DE39D300C5ED8BD98D69910BB9B8EBFC23A9A8C28D1828A4B7786737264556009FA2B06FFD865C1DE6DB88B845A336C;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"changelog\"></a>\n\n## Changelog\n\n2024-07-29\n\n- Added **FW-14863** | New Excrypt command\n",
      "en": "# EMSD: Sign EMV data\n\nFuente: [EMSD: Sign EMV data](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/payments_cards/emv/acquiring/emsd-sign-emv-data)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:02:34.342Z\n\n---\n\n**Available in FW 7.6.1.4 and later**\n\nThis command signs EMV data.\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| EMV Acquiring | Enables the Europay Mastercard Visa (EMV) acquiring command set. |\n| RSA | Enables commands requiring RSA functionality. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | **﻿**`EMSD` |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-used-for-asymmetric-key\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major key used for asymmetric key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK (default)<br>`6`: PMK<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"rc-encrypted-private-key-used-to-generate-the-signature\"></a>\n\n### RC - Encrypted Private Key used to generate the signature\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"bo-hex-encoded-data-used-to-generate-the-signature\"></a>\n\n### BO - Hex encoded data used to generate the signature\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-8192 | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `EMSD` |\n\n<a id=\"rh-hex-encoded-signature-generated\"></a>\n\n### RH - Hex Encoded Signature Generated\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command example\n\n```\nRequest:[AOEMSD;BO6AF4E28FE3F0374C1EC4B971969815299A573CCA2D5B84CADDFBC72339FB24E429CC0A1C73711AA87BB4841BC50FB7981691E22BB78AAC12EB0E7769AE2F9AA4C7E6B42E03D79D731CA6FB159C255A118A53A1DB4049BD992BCEA06BD79163B041511603B5321FE2D166EAE0FB1FF5F722803BA4E69BD5D16666BF50020720BC;FS6;;] &#x9;\n\nResponse:[AOEMSD;RH30D7990BA9840316FDBD75C640548F397C74E65FDA29A4B98448B204A826153BF186AEC1EA7C107823FAC4F92FFC4F1A58EFCE5BF6F369E1671AC6C2F8BEEA050267CF9B04723A11AAE0F201E6C438D42DE39D300C5ED8BD98D69910BB9B8EBFC23A9A8C28D1828A4B7786737264556009FA2B06FFD865C1DE6DB88B845A336C;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"changelog\"></a>\n\n## Changelog\n\n2024-07-29\n\n- Added **FW-14863** | New Excrypt command\n"
