      "es": "This command derives a key from the vendor master key (KMC) and derivation data.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command has the following modes: split data mode and single data mode.\n- Derive key from vendor master key (KMC) and derivation data. \n\n  - The derived key, in split data mode, is found by: \n\n    - `DES3(KMC)[DerivationDataLeft] || DES3(KMC)[DerivationDataRight]`\n  - The derived key, in single data mode, is found by: \n\n    - `DES3(KMC)[DerivationDataLeft]`",
      "en": "This command derives a key from the vendor master key (KMC) and derivation data.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command has the following modes: split data mode and single data mode.\n- Derive key from vendor master key (KMC) and derivation data. \n\n  - The derived key, in split data mode, is found by: \n\n    - `DES3(KMC)[DerivationDataLeft] || DES3(KMC)[DerivationDataRight]`\n  - The derived key, in single data mode, is found by: \n\n    - `DES3(KMC)[DerivationDataLeft]`"
