      "es": "# EMVT: EMV Translate Sensitive Data\n\nFuente: [EMVT: EMV Translate Sensitive Data](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/payments_cards/emv/issuance/emvt-emv-translate-sensitive-data)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:02:39.669Z\n\n---\n\nThis command decrypts incoming data under an incoming key and encrypts it under an outgoing key.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| EMV Issuing | Enables the Europay Mastercard Visa (EMV) issuance command set. EMV is a global standard for card-based transactions. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `EMVT` |\n\n<a id=\"bo-incoming-encrypted-data\"></a>\n\n### BO - Incoming encrypted data\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-2048 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"ai-incoming-key\"></a>\n\n### AI - Incoming key\n\nThis field supports the following formats:\n\n- Cryptogram encrypted under modifier 1D of the MFK\n- AKB or TR-31 key block\n- Key Storage Table index\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16<br>32<br>48 | Hexadecimal | **Cryptogram**<br>0-9, A-F |\n| 74<br>88+ | ASCII | **Key block**<br>A - Z, a - z, 0 - 9 except ; [ ] |\n| 3-7 | Alphanumeric | BD + key slot number |\n\n<a id=\"aj-outgoing-key\"></a>\n\n### AJ - Outgoing key\n\nThis field supports the following formats:\n\n- Cryptogram encrypted under modifier 1D of the MFK\n- AKB or TR-31 key block\n- Key Storage Table index\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16<br>32<br>48 | Hexadecimal | **Cryptogram**<br>0-9, A-F |\n| 74<br>88+ | ASCII | **Key block**<br>A - Z, a - z, 0 - 9 except ; [ ] |\n| 3-7 | Alphanumeric | BD + key slot number |\n\n<a id=\"optional-bj-incoming-encryption-mode\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) BJ - Incoming encryption mode\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `0`: ECB (default)<br>`1`: CBC |\n\n<a id=\"optional-bk-outgoing-encryption-mode\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) BK - Outgoing encryption mode\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `0`: ECB (default)<br>`1`: CBC |\n\n<a id=\"gh-incoming-iv\"></a>\n\n### GH - Incoming IV\n\nOnly used if incoming mode is CBC (token **BK** = `1`). If not present, it defaults to an IV of binary zeros.\n\nThis field supports the following formats:\n\n- Cryptogram encrypted under modifier 6 of the MFK\n- AKB or TR-31 key block\n- Key Storage Table index\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16 | Hexadecimal | **Cryptogram**<br>0-9, A-F |\n| 74<br>88+ | ASCII | **Key block**<br>A - Z, a - z, 0 - 9 except ; [ ] |\n| 3-7 | Alphanumeric | BD + key slot number |\n\n<a id=\"gk-outgoing-iv\"></a>\n\n### GK - Outgoing IV\n\nOnly used if outgoing mode is CBC (token **BK** = `1`). If not present, it defaults to an IV of binary zeros.\n\nThis field supports the following formats:\n\n- Cryptogram encrypted under modifier 6 of the MFK\n- AKB or TR-31 key block\n- Key Storage Table index\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16 | Hexadecimal | **Cryptogram**<br>0-9, A-F |\n| 74<br>88+ | ASCII | **Key block**<br>A - Z, a - z, 0 - 9 except ; [ ] |\n| 3-7 | Alphanumeric | BD + key slot number |\n\n<a id=\"optional-at-input-padding\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) AT - Input padding\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `0`: No padding (default)<br>`1`: PKCS Standard Padding<br>`2`: Bit Padding (0x80 … 0x00) |\n\n<a id=\"optional-au-output-padding\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) AU - Output padding\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `0`: No padding (default)<br>`1`: PKCS Standard Padding<br>`2`: Bit Padding (0x80 … 0x00) |\n\n<a id=\"optional-av-input-length-header\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) AV - Input Length Header\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `0`: No Length Header (default)<br>`1`: One-byte length header<br>`2`: Two-byte network-order length header |\n\n<a id=\"optional-aw-output-length-header\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) AW - Output Length Header\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `0`: No Length Header (default)<br>`1`: One-byte length header<br>`2`: Two-byte network-order length header |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `EMVT` |\n\n<a id=\"bo-translated-output\"></a>\n\n### BO - Translated Output\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"xa-incoming-key-check-digits\"></a>\n\n### XA - Incoming Key Check Digits\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 8 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"xb-outgoing-key-check-digits\"></a>\n\n### XB - Outgoing Key Check Digits\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 8 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command Example\n\n```\nRequest: [AOEMVT;AI413C2A7A172E9AA032AD146AE7118101;AJ3A7F721AF6AF02DD0EB3CAA0F993835A;BJ1;BK0;GHDDBC51B27C744F14;AT1;AU1;BOA2D5480C1494939291054FF9A65C3049512DC675FA3AEE264358CE0EA253EAD07B65F89C0C7A8239009CDCE1107B9F3F556598B85ECCE5E964A73E1C948D783214EBD2B8B12D2BD10E728574D81CB4379AB4DCE513965354F314A7275142BAFFA869B6593D147089E36FB248238A102C9EB9E7A1999E34C1;]]\n\nResponse: [AOEMVT;BO66E263E77EC49943C2B0029AD76A90AE91056AAC2BA79D371204ED34DA5C9D7AF779DC2AFC885ADFCAD5E57900F9AF244117EF65259152818F465527C35B60922B101FD483E0534CAEE72B923B738662D9B56FC4B9AAACAD988CA069FBBFACF33337BE072677064E77E0386316D1549E914FE995E5DEDEE3;XA8BDE;XBF35A;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nMFK Test Key: D2DE5CD9110F4CAB 1111111111111111 0123456789ABCDEF Check Digit: (financial 8071) (cmac 9652)\n",
