      "en": "# GFPE: FF3-1 Format Preserving Encryption\n\nFuente: [GFPE: FF3-1 Format Preserving Encryption](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/data_encryption/format_preserving/gfpe-ff3-1-format-preserving-encryption)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:03:30.837Z\n\n---\n\nThis command encrypts data by using NIST 800-38G-rev FF3-1 Format Preserving Encryption. The output matches the format and length of the input.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| Format-Preserving Encryption | Enables Format Preserving Encryption (FPE) functionality. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nGFPE (ASCII/Excrypt-safe) — Request tokens\n\nGFPE (binary) — Request tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GFPE` |\n\n<a id=\"bg-aes-key-under-modifier-2\"></a>\n\n### BG - AES key under modifier 2\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-512 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major Key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK<br>`6`: PMK (default)<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"choose-either-ascii/excrypt-safe-or-binary-for-input-data\"></a>\n\n### Choose either ASCII/Excrypt-Safe or Binary for Input Data\n\n<a id=\"ascii-/-excrypt-safe\"></a>\n\n## ASCII / Excrypt-Safe\n\n<a id=\"av-input-data\"></a>\n\n### AV - Input data\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4096 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"optional-gh-tweak\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) GH - Tweak\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 0-4096 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"optional-ns-namespace\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) NS - Namespace\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-256 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"binary\"></a>\n\n## Binary\n\n<a id=\"bo-input-data\"></a>\n\n### BO - Input data\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-8192 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"optional-gi-tweak\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) GI - Tweak\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 0-8192 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"optional-nt-namespace\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) NT - Namespace\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-512 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GFPE` |\n\n<a id=\"ascii-/-excrypt-safe-2\"></a>\n\n### ASCII / Excrypt-Safe\n\n<a id=\"av-output-data\"></a>\n\n#### AV - Output data\n\nOnly returned if you send request token **AV**.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4096 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"binary-2\"></a>\n\n### Binary\n\n<a id=\"bo-output-data\"></a>\n\n#### BO - Output data\n\nOnly returned if you send request token **BO**.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-8192 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"specific-error-codes\"></a>\n\n### Specific error codes:\n\n- **03**: VALUE_OUT_OF_RANGE\n- **63**: INCORRECT_KEY_TYPE\n- **81**: SYMMETRIC_CRYPTO_ERROR\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command Example\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGFPE;FS6;BG91A8D61458E1A026445082F43E792D0675715A119BA4DBCCD0CA12B14CC5B4233FE964657601E220;AV89012123456789000000789000000;]\n\nResponse: [AOGFPE;AV34695224821734535122613701434;]\n```\n"
