    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# GHTD: Generate Hash from Terminal Data\n\nFuente: [GHTD: Generate Hash from Terminal Data](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/system/utility/ghtd-generate-hash-from-terminal-data)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:03:36.711Z\n\n---\n\nThis command receives an encrypted payload and decrypts it. It strips the first 16 hex digits from the payload and generates a SHA-512 hash from the remaining data.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in FIPS mode\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command ID | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `BO` | Incoming data encrypted under PKI public key | Hexadecimal | 2-8192 | Yes |\n| `RC` | Incoming private key under modifier 0 of the major key | Hexadecimal | Variable | Yes |\n| `AT` | Incoming padding | Numeric | 1 | Optional |\n| `FS` | Major key to used | Numeric | 1 | Optional |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Response ID | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `RH` | Hex-encoded SHA-512 hash | Hexadecimal | 128 |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GHTD` |\n\n<a id=\"bo-incoming-data-encrypted-under-pki-public-key\"></a>\n\n### BO - Incoming data encrypted under PKI public key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-8192 | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"rc-incoming-private-key-under-modifier-0-of-the-major-key\"></a>\n\n### RC - Incoming private key under modifier 0 of the major key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"optional-rsa-only-at-incoming-padding\"></a>\n\n### (Optional, RSA only) AT - Incoming padding\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: PKCS Standard Padding (default)<br>`4`: OAEP Padding |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-to-used\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major key to used\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK (default)<br>`6`: PMK<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GHTD` |\n\n<a id=\"rh-hex-encoded-sha-512-hash\"></a>\n\n### RH - Hex-encoded SHA-512 hash\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 128 | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command examples\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGHTD;;;AT1;]\n\nResponse: [AOGHTD;RH9E47EB7E7D14B75BBBFFE06AA552BA447E5ADC76C7602244C25C674763BB371C9117700B75CFF2B0E7CE488523A48A3D3F2CED098288A5B4CF0C7F71DBF4426D;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nMFK Test Key: D2DE5CD9110F4CAB 1111111111111111 0123456789ABCDEF Check Digit: (financial 8071) (cmac 9652)\n\n<a id=\"changelog\"></a>\n\n## Changelog\n\n2026-05-27\n\n- Added **FW-19082** | Added support for translating between different RSA-OAEP hash algorithms.\n",
      "en": "# GHTD: Generate Hash from Terminal Data\n\nFuente: [GHTD: Generate Hash from Terminal Data](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/system/utility/ghtd-generate-hash-from-terminal-data)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:03:36.711Z\n\n---\n\nThis command receives an encrypted payload and decrypts it. It strips the first 16 hex digits from the payload and generates a SHA-512 hash from the remaining data.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in FIPS mode\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command ID | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `BO` | Incoming data encrypted under PKI public key | Hexadecimal | 2-8192 | Yes |\n| `RC` | Incoming private key under modifier 0 of the major key | Hexadecimal | Variable | Yes |\n| `AT` | Incoming padding | Numeric | 1 | Optional |\n| `FS` | Major key to used | Numeric | 1 | Optional |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Response ID | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `RH` | Hex-encoded SHA-512 hash | Hexadecimal | 128 |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GHTD` |\n\n<a id=\"bo-incoming-data-encrypted-under-pki-public-key\"></a>\n\n### BO - Incoming data encrypted under PKI public key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-8192 | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"rc-incoming-private-key-under-modifier-0-of-the-major-key\"></a>\n\n### RC - Incoming private key under modifier 0 of the major key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"optional-rsa-only-at-incoming-padding\"></a>\n\n### (Optional, RSA only) AT - Incoming padding\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: PKCS Standard Padding (default)<br>`4`: OAEP Padding |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-to-used\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major key to used\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK (default)<br>`6`: PMK<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GHTD` |\n\n<a id=\"rh-hex-encoded-sha-512-hash\"></a>\n\n### RH - Hex-encoded SHA-512 hash\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 128 | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command examples\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGHTD;;;AT1;]\n\nResponse: [AOGHTD;RH9E47EB7E7D14B75BBBFFE06AA552BA447E5ADC76C7602244C25C674763BB371C9117700B75CFF2B0E7CE488523A48A3D3F2CED098288A5B4CF0C7F71DBF4426D;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nMFK Test Key: D2DE5CD9110F4CAB 1111111111111111 0123456789ABCDEF Check Digit: (financial 8071) (cmac 9652)\n\n<a id=\"changelog\"></a>\n\n## Changelog\n\n2026-05-27\n\n- Added **FW-19082** | Added support for translating between different RSA-OAEP hash algorithms.\n"
    }
