      "es": "This command generates a cryptogram by retrieving it from a key slot under the user-designated major key.\n\nNotes\n\n- This command does not work on sensitive keys.\n- This command supports Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) keys. You must enable the PQC license to use these keys.\n- Converting the PQC key table slot to cryptogram is currently disabled in PCI HSM mode pending PCI approval.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode",
