      "es": "# GPKD: General Purpose Key Slot Delete/Clear\n\nFuente: [GPKD: General Purpose Key Slot Delete/Clear](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/keys/lifecycle/gpkd-general-purpose-key-slot-deleteclear)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:04:01.964Z\n\n---\n\nThis command clears a loaded key slot.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"required-permissions\"></a>\n\n## Required permissions\n\n| Permission | Description | Port | Min Logins |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Keys | View key and table information | Mgmt | 0 |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GPKD` |\n\n<a id=\"bd-key-slot-or-key-label\"></a>\n\n### BD - Key slot or key label\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Alphanumeric | A-Z, a-z, 0-9, ”_”, ”-“ |\n\n<a id=\"optional-classic+aes-ct-key-type-for-token-bd\"></a>\n\n### (Optional - Classic+AES) CT - Key type for token BD\n\nDefault: Symmetric Key Type\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-2 | Numeric | `0`: Empty<br>`1`: DES-1<br>`2`: DES-2<br>`3`: DES-3<br>`4`: AES-128<br>`5`: AES-192<br>`6`: AES-256<br>`7`: Diebold<br>`8`: RSA-512<br>`9`: RSA-1024<br>`10`: RSA-2048<br>`11`: RSA-3072<br>`12`: RSA-4096 |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GPKD` |\n\n<a id=\"bb-deletion-confirmation\"></a>\n\n### BB - Deletion confirmation\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Key in slot was cleared<br>`N`: Key in slot was not cleared |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command Examples\n\n<a id=\"key-slot\"></a>\n\n## Key Slot\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGPKD;BD100;]\n\nResponse: [AOGPKD;BBY;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"key-with-label-labela\"></a>\n\n## Key with label: LabelA\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGPKD;BDLBLabelA;]\n\nResponse: [AOGPKD;BBY;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"changelog\"></a>\n\n## Changelog\n\n2025-02-28\n\n- Fixed **FW-9164** | Resolved an issue with the command not respecting the DES security policy when parsing key type.\n",
      "en": "# GPKD: General Purpose Key Slot Delete/Clear\n\nFuente: [GPKD: General Purpose Key Slot Delete/Clear](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/keys/lifecycle/gpkd-general-purpose-key-slot-deleteclear)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:04:01.964Z\n\n---\n\nThis command clears a loaded key slot.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"required-permissions\"></a>\n\n## Required permissions\n\n| Permission | Description | Port | Min Logins |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Keys | View key and table information | Mgmt | 0 |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GPKD` |\n\n<a id=\"bd-key-slot-or-key-label\"></a>\n\n### BD - Key slot or key label\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Alphanumeric | A-Z, a-z, 0-9, ”_”, ”-“ |\n\n<a id=\"optional-classic+aes-ct-key-type-for-token-bd\"></a>\n\n### (Optional - Classic+AES) CT - Key type for token BD\n\nDefault: Symmetric Key Type\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-2 | Numeric | `0`: Empty<br>`1`: DES-1<br>`2`: DES-2<br>`3`: DES-3<br>`4`: AES-128<br>`5`: AES-192<br>`6`: AES-256<br>`7`: Diebold<br>`8`: RSA-512<br>`9`: RSA-1024<br>`10`: RSA-2048<br>`11`: RSA-3072<br>`12`: RSA-4096 |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GPKD` |\n\n<a id=\"bb-deletion-confirmation\"></a>\n\n### BB - Deletion confirmation\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Key in slot was cleared<br>`N`: Key in slot was not cleared |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command Examples\n\n<a id=\"key-slot\"></a>\n\n## Key Slot\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGPKD;BD100;]\n\nResponse: [AOGPKD;BBY;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"key-with-label-labela\"></a>\n\n## Key with label: LabelA\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGPKD;BDLBLabelA;]\n\nResponse: [AOGPKD;BBY;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"changelog\"></a>\n\n## Changelog\n\n2025-02-28\n\n- Fixed **FW-9164** | Resolved an issue with the command not respecting the DES security policy when parsing key type.\n"
