    "summary": {
      "es": "This command converts a key under a major key (any modifier) to under a symmetric Key Encryption Key (KEK) (modifier 0).\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command is part of the **GPKW** family. To view more information about how this command works with other commands in the **GPKW** family, see the **GPKW Family** resource.\n- Requires Dual Control if specifying token **BJ**.\n- AES KWP requires the **Keys:No Usage Wrap** permissions.",
      "en": "This command converts a key under a major key (any modifier) to under a symmetric Key Encryption Key (KEK) (modifier 0).\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command is part of the **GPKW** family. To view more information about how this command works with other commands in the **GPKW** family, see the **GPKW Family** resource.\n- Requires Dual Control if specifying token **BJ**.\n- AES KWP requires the **Keys:No Usage Wrap** permissions."
    },
