    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# GUSR: Logout\n\nFuente: [GUSR: Logout](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/system/authentication/GUSR/logout)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:04:38.553Z\n\n---\n\nThis mode logs out all users or a single user session.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-indicator\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"da-identity-name\"></a>\n\n### DA - Identity name\n\nOnly required if logging out of one user session.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-46 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"lo-logout-indicator\"></a>\n\n### LO - Logout indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1` |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-indicator-2\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"da-identity-name-2\"></a>\n\n### DA - Identity name\n\nOnly returned if logging out a single user session and request token **DA**is sent.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-46 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"cn-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### CN - Success indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y` |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command Examples\n\n<a id=\"log-out-all-users\"></a>\n\n### Log out all users\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGUSR;LO1;]\n\nResponse: [AOGUSR;CNY;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"log-out-a-single-user\"></a>\n\n### Log out a single user\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGUSR;DAAdmin1;LO1;]\n\nResponse: [AOGUSR;DAAdmin1;CNY;]\n```\n",
      "en": "# GUSR: Logout\n\nFuente: [GUSR: Logout](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/system/authentication/GUSR/logout)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:04:38.553Z\n\n---\n\nThis mode logs out all users or a single user session.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-indicator\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"da-identity-name\"></a>\n\n### DA - Identity name\n\nOnly required if logging out of one user session.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-46 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"lo-logout-indicator\"></a>\n\n### LO - Logout indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1` |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-indicator-2\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"da-identity-name-2\"></a>\n\n### DA - Identity name\n\nOnly returned if logging out a single user session and request token **DA**is sent.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-46 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"cn-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### CN - Success indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y` |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command Examples\n\n<a id=\"log-out-all-users\"></a>\n\n### Log out all users\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGUSR;LO1;]\n\nResponse: [AOGUSR;CNY;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"log-out-a-single-user\"></a>\n\n### Log out a single user\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGUSR;DAAdmin1;LO1;]\n\nResponse: [AOGUSR;DAAdmin1;CNY;]\n```\n"
    }
