    "name": {
      "es": "GUSR: Password Login",
      "en": "GUSR: Password Login"
    },
    "summary": {
      "es": "This command allows authentication to the HSM, and you can use it over a TLS production port connection to log into application partitions.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- After successfully logging in, if you send token **TF,** the command returns a JSON web token (JWT), response token **JW**. You can then send this **JW** token in all other Excrypt commands to prove authentication.\n- The JWT is good for 10 minutes. Within a minute of expiring, any command sent with the JWT returns a refreshed token that is good for another 10 minutes (a session refresh).",
      "en": "This command allows authentication to the HSM, and you can use it over a TLS production port connection to log into application partitions.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- After successfully logging in, if you send token **TF,** the command returns a JSON web token (JWT), response token **JW**. You can then send this **JW** token in all other Excrypt commands to prove authentication.\n- The JWT is good for 10 minutes. Within a minute of expiring, any command sent with the JWT returns a refreshed token that is good for another 10 minutes (a session refresh)."
    },
    "description": {
      "es": "This command allows authentication to the HSM, and you can use it over a TLS production port connection to log into application partitions.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- After successfully logging in, if you send token **TF,** the command returns a JSON web token (JWT), response token **JW**. You can then send this **JW** token in all other Excrypt commands to prove authentication.\n- The JWT is good for 10 minutes. Within a minute of expiring, any command sent with the JWT returns a refreshed token that is good for another 10 minutes (a session refresh).",
      "en": "This command allows authentication to the HSM, and you can use it over a TLS production port connection to log into application partitions.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- After successfully logging in, if you send token **TF,** the command returns a JSON web token (JWT), response token **JW**. You can then send this **JW** token in all other Excrypt commands to prove authentication.\n- The JWT is good for 10 minutes. Within a minute of expiring, any command sent with the JWT returns a refreshed token that is good for another 10 minutes (a session refresh)."
    },
