      "es": "# GUSR: Token Login\n\nFuente: [GUSR: Token Login](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/system/authentication/GUSR/token-login)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:04:40.289Z\n\n---\n\nThis command uses a previously generated authentication token to authenticate with the HSM.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Requires local connection\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Indicator | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `TO` | Login token previously received | Hexadecimal | 64-2048 | Yes |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command indicator | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `CN` | Success indicator | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `BO` | Is legacy admin role? | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `LB` | Is semi-authorized? | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `LC` | Is fully logged in? | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `UL` | User logins complete | Numeric | Variable |\n| `UT` | User logins required total | Numeric | Variable |\n| `UR` | User logins remaining | Numeric | Variable |\n| `US` | CSV of fully logged-in users | ASCII | Variable |\n| `RO` | CSV of fully logged-in roles | ASCII | Variable |\n| `PR` | CSV of permissions | ASCII | Variable |\n| `DA` | Identity name | ASCII | Variable |\n| `DP` | Is default password login? (safe) | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `EB` | Legacy role type identifier | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `EX` | Password expired? | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `ET` | Password expiration time | Integer | Variable |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-indicator\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"to-login-token-previously-received\"></a>\n\n### TO - Login token previously received\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 64-2048 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-indicator-2\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"cn-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### CN - Success indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Successful<br>`N`: Not successful |\n\n<a id=\"bo-is-legacy-admin-role\"></a>\n\n### BO - Is legacy admin role?\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `N`: No<br>`Y`: Yes |\n\n<a id=\"lb-is-semi-authorized\"></a>\n\n### LB - Is semi-authorized?\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y, N` |\n\n<a id=\"lc-is-fully-logged-in\"></a>\n\n### LC - Is fully logged in?\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y, N` |\n\n<a id=\"ul-user-logins-complete\"></a>\n\n### UL - User logins complete\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Numeric | 0-9 |\n\n<a id=\"ut-user-logins-required-total\"></a>\n\n### UT - User logins required total\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Numeric | 0-9 |\n\n<a id=\"ur-user-logins-remaining\"></a>\n\n### UR - User logins remaining\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Numeric | 0-9 |\n\n<a id=\"us-csv-of-fully-logged-in-users\"></a>\n\n### US - CSV of fully logged-in users\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"ro-csv-of-fully-logged-in-roles\"></a>\n\n### RO - CSV of fully logged-in roles\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"pr-csv-of-permissions\"></a>\n\n### PR - CSV of permissions\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"da-identity-name\"></a>\n\n### DA - Identity name\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"dp-is-default-password-login-safe\"></a>\n\n### DP - Is default password login? (safe)\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `N`: No<br>`Y`: Yes |\n\n<a id=\"eb-legacy-role-type-identifier\"></a>\n\n### EB - Legacy role type identifier\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `C`: Admin<br>`K`: Key Manager<br>`N`: None<br>`P`: Crypto Operator<br>`U`: Operations |\n\n<a id=\"ex-password-expired\"></a>\n\n### EX - Password expired?\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `N`: No<br>`Y`: Yes |\n\n<a id=\"et-password-expiration-time\"></a>\n\n### ET - Password expiration time\n\nOnly present if password expiration is enabled. The following types of values are possible:\n\n- Positive value = Seconds till expired\n- Negative value = Negative seconds since expired\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Integer | 0-9 |\n",
