      "es": "# GUSR: U2F Login\n\nFuente: [GUSR: U2F Login](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/system/authentication/GUSR/u2f-login)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:04:40.353Z\n\n---\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Indicator | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `TH` | Continuation ID previously received | Numeric | Variable | Yes |\n| `TF` | Major key to use as a base for issuing JWT | Numeric | 1 | Optional |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Response Indicator | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `CN` | Success indicator | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `JW` | JSON web token | Base64 | Variable |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-indicator\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"th-continuation-id-previously-received\"></a>\n\n### TH - Continuation ID previously received\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Numeric | 0-9 |\n\n<a id=\"optional-tf-major-key-to-use-as-a-base-for-issuing-jwt\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) TF - Major key to use as a base for issuing JWT\n\nIf you send this, a JSON web token (JWT) returns in response token **JW**.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `6`: PMK<br>`7`: FTK |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-indicator\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"cn-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### CN - Success indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Successful |\n\n<a id=\"jw-json-web-token\"></a>\n\n### JW - JSON web token\n\nIf you send request token **TF**.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Base64 | A-Z, a-z, 0-9, “+”, ”/”, = |\n",
