    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# GUSR: User Status\n\nFuente: [GUSR: User Status](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/system/authentication/GUSR/user-status)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:04:39.764Z\n\n---\n\nThis command mode outputs the status of a single selected identity.\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-indicator\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"da-name-of-the-identity-to-retrieve-the-status-of\"></a>\n\n### DA - Name of the identity to retrieve the status of\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-64 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-indicator\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"cn-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### CN - Success Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Successful |\n\n<a id=\"da-identity-name\"></a>\n\n### DA - Identity name\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-64 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"dp-password-of-the-identity-is-the-default-password\"></a>\n\n### DP - Password of the identity is the default password?\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `N`: No<br>`Y`: Yes |\n\n<a id=\"eb-legacy-role-type-identifier\"></a>\n\n### EB - Legacy role type identifier\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `C`: Admin<br>`K`: Key Manager<br>`N`: None<br>`P`: Crypto Operator<br>`U`: Operations |\n\n<a id=\"ex-password-of-the-identity-has-expired\"></a>\n\n### EX - Password of the identity has expired?\n\nIf token **ET** is not returned, expiration is not enabled for the identity, and **EX** always has the value `N`.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `N`: No<br>`Y`: Yes |\n\n<a id=\"et-number-of-seconds-until-expiration-if-positive\"></a>\n\n### ET - Number of seconds until expiration (if positive)\n\nNumber of seconds since expiration (if negative)\n\nNot returned if expiration is not enabled for the identity.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Integer | 0-9 |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command example\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGUSR;DAAdmin1;]\n\nResponse: [AOGUSR;CNY;DAAdmin1;DPN;EBC;EXN;]\n```\n",
      "en": "# GUSR: User Status\n\nFuente: [GUSR: User Status](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/system/authentication/GUSR/user-status)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:04:39.764Z\n\n---\n\nThis command mode outputs the status of a single selected identity.\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-indicator\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"da-name-of-the-identity-to-retrieve-the-status-of\"></a>\n\n### DA - Name of the identity to retrieve the status of\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-64 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-indicator\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `GUSR` |\n\n<a id=\"cn-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### CN - Success Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Successful |\n\n<a id=\"da-identity-name\"></a>\n\n### DA - Identity name\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-64 | ASCII | A-Z, a-z, 0-9 except ; [ ] |\n\n<a id=\"dp-password-of-the-identity-is-the-default-password\"></a>\n\n### DP - Password of the identity is the default password?\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `N`: No<br>`Y`: Yes |\n\n<a id=\"eb-legacy-role-type-identifier\"></a>\n\n### EB - Legacy role type identifier\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `C`: Admin<br>`K`: Key Manager<br>`N`: None<br>`P`: Crypto Operator<br>`U`: Operations |\n\n<a id=\"ex-password-of-the-identity-has-expired\"></a>\n\n### EX - Password of the identity has expired?\n\nIf token **ET** is not returned, expiration is not enabled for the identity, and **EX** always has the value `N`.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `N`: No<br>`Y`: Yes |\n\n<a id=\"et-number-of-seconds-until-expiration-if-positive\"></a>\n\n### ET - Number of seconds until expiration (if positive)\n\nNumber of seconds since expiration (if negative)\n\nNot returned if expiration is not enabled for the identity.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Integer | 0-9 |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command example\n\n```\nRequest: [AOGUSR;DAAdmin1;]\n\nResponse: [AOGUSR;CNY;DAAdmin1;DPN;EBC;EXN;]\n```\n"
    }
