      "es": "# KCBC: KEK to CBC Encryption\n\nFuente: [KCBC: KEK to CBC Encryption](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/data_encryption/symmetric/kcbc-kek-to-cbc-encryption)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:05:18.604Z\n\n---\n\nThis command takes in a key encrypted under the KEK and translates it so that it is encrypted under the CBC encryption. This command requires the input of a modifier, outgoing modifier, KEK, initial vector, and the key.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- The encryption algorithm uses an Initialization Vector (IV) for randomization.\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `KCBC` |\n\n<a id=\"as-input-modifier\"></a>\n\n### AS - Input Modifier\n\nSee **Key identifiers** resource.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-2 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"ak-outgoing-modifier\"></a>\n\n### AK - Outgoing Modifier\n\nSee **Key identifiers** resource.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-2 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"ap-key-encryption-key-kek\"></a>\n\n### AP - Key Encryption Key (KEK)\n\nIf not supplied, the register KEK is used.\n\nThis field supports the following formats:\n\n- Cryptogram\n- Key Storage Table index\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16<br>32<br>48 | Hexadecimal | **Cryptogram**<br>0 - 9, A - F |\n| 3-7 | Alphanumeric | BD + key slot number |\n\n<a id=\"gh-initial-vector\"></a>\n\n### GH - Initial Vector\n\nIf not supplied, the command uses all zeros.\n\nThis field supports the following formats:\n\n- Cryptogram\n- Key Storage Table index\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16<br>32<br>48 | Hexadecimal | **Cryptogram**<br>0 - 9, A - F |\n| 3-7 | Alphanumeric | BD + key slot number |\n\n<a id=\"bg-key-encrypted-under-modifier-as-of-the-kek\"></a>\n\n### BG - Key encrypted under modifier AS of the KEK\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16<br>32<br>48 | Hexadecimal | **Cryptogram**<br>0 - 9, A - F |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `KCBC` |\n\n<a id=\"as-modifier-of-the-input-encryption-used\"></a>\n\n### AS - Modifier of the input encryption used\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-2 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"ak-modifier-that-the-result-is-encrypted\"></a>\n\n### AK - Modifier that the result is encrypted\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-2 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"bg-key-encrypted-under-cbc-encryption\"></a>\n\n### BG - Key encrypted under CBC encryption\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16<br>32<br>48 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"gh-initial-vector-under-cbc-encryption\"></a>\n\n### GH - Initial vector under CBC encryption\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16<br>32<br>48 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"ae-check-sum\"></a>\n\n### AE - Check Sum\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command examples\n\n<a id=\"example-1\"></a>\n\n### Example 1\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK0;AP1111222233334444;GH1111000011110000;BG2222333344445555;]\n\nResponse: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK0;BGAFC3ECB8BEE3BABC;GHDFFD0F350DC2FFA3;AEA62E;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-2\"></a>\n\n### Example 2\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS1;AK0;AP1111222233334444;GH1111000011110000;BG2222333344445555;]\n\nResponse: [AOKCBC;AS1;AK0;BG136864D958385971;GH6EE4724BB09FD221;AE7E4A;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-3\"></a>\n\n### Example 3\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS9;AK0;AP1111222233334444;GH1111000011110000;BG2222333344445555;]\n\nResponse: [AOKCBC;AS9;AK0;BG46C50E9C8EEA78CA;GH5F7597EBB85A4A7F;AE37AD;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-4\"></a>\n\n### Example 4\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;ASF;AK0;AP1111222233334444;GH1111000011110000;BG2222333344445555;]\n\nResponse: [AOKCBC;ASF;AK0;BG096FB4C845A6567F;GH4BC9A1DD926F2808;AEDC5A;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-5\"></a>\n\n### Example 5\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;ASF2;AK0;AP1111222233334444;GH1111000011110000;BG2222333344445555;]\n\nResponse: [AOKCBC;ASF2;AK0;BGD8015F8DCE32951E;GH449A81F7457E1E31;AEBADD;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-6\"></a>\n\n### Example 6\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK9;AP1111222233334444;GH1111000011110000;BG2222333344445555;]\n\nResponse: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK9;BGAFC3ECB8BEE3BABC;GHDFFD0F350DC2FFA3;AEA62E;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-7\"></a>\n\n### Example 7\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK4;AP1111222233334444;GH1111000011110000;BG2222333344445555;]\n\nResponse: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK4;BGAFC3ECB8BEE3BABC;GHDFFD0F350DC2FFA3;AEA62E;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-8\"></a>\n\n### Example 8\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK4;GH1111000011110000;BG22223333444455551111222255554444;]\n\nResponse:[AOKCBC;AS0;AK4;BG00114377DDC227F4B88A65AD767E1793;GHF2C087BBE8CBCF52;AEABDB;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-9\"></a>\n\n### Example 9\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK4;GH1111000011110000;BG222233334444555511112222555544444444111122225555;]\n\nResponse:[AOKCBC;AS0;AK4;BG00114377DDC227F4B88A65AD767E1793AF7F8672E221D29A;GH7507EE0A34141159;AEC6B9;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"with-errors\"></a>\n\n### With Errors\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK41;AP1111222233334444;GH1111000011110000;BG2222333344445555;]\n\nResponse: [AOERRO;AM13;ANAK;BBINVALID MESSAGE LENGTH;]\n```\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK4;AP1111222233334444555556666777788881111222233334444;GH11110000\n  111100001111222233334444;BG22223333444455551111222255554444;]\n\nResponse: [AOERRO;AM01;ANAP;BBFIELD OUT OF RANGE;]\n```\n\n```\nRequest: [AOKCBC;AS0;AK4;AP11112222333344445555666677778888111122223333444411112222333344445555666677778888;GH1111000011110000;BG2222333344445555;]\n\nResponse:[AOERRO;AM01;ANAP;BBFIELD OUT OF RANGE;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nMFK Test Key: D2DE5CD9110F4CAB 1111111111111111 0123456789ABCDEF Check Digit: (financial 8071) (cmac 9652)\n",
