    "summary": {
      "es": "This command derives a key from a user-supplied key and derivation data.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- You can find the derived key by using the following methods:  \n\n  - Splitting the data into two parts\n  - Using a single data mode\n- After the key is derived, the HSM then performs a triple DES encryption by using the major key.",
      "en": "This command derives a key from a user-supplied key and derivation data.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- You can find the derived key by using the following methods:  \n\n  - Splitting the data into two parts\n  - Using a single data mode\n- After the key is derived, the HSM then performs a triple DES encryption by using the major key."
    },
    "description": {
      "es": "This command derives a key from a user-supplied key and derivation data.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- You can find the derived key by using the following methods:  \n\n  - Splitting the data into two parts\n  - Using a single data mode\n- After the key is derived, the HSM then performs a triple DES encryption by using the major key.",
      "en": "This command derives a key from a user-supplied key and derivation data.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- You can find the derived key by using the following methods:  \n\n  - Splitting the data into two parts\n  - Using a single data mode\n- After the key is derived, the HSM then performs a triple DES encryption by using the major key."
    },
