      "es": "This command generates a new composite key block by combining encrypted component key blocks.\n\n**Available in FW 7.6.1.20 and later.**\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Key Type, Key Usage, Mode of Use, and Exportability must be the same for every component.\n- Component key versions must be **c1** through **c9** (lowercase c).\n- Component keys must be inputted into corresponding tokens (such as **KA** = **c1**, **KB** = **c2**, … **KI** = **c9** ).\n- Optional header blocks on components are stripped away from the output. Optional blocks on the output require the use of the **AK** token.",
      "en": "This command generates a new composite key block by combining encrypted component key blocks.\n\n**Available in FW 7.6.1.20 and later.**\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Key Type, Key Usage, Mode of Use, and Exportability must be the same for every component.\n- Component key versions must be **c1** through **c9** (lowercase c).\n- Component keys must be inputted into corresponding tokens (such as **KA** = **c1**, **KB** = **c2**, … **KI** = **c9** ).\n- Optional header blocks on components are stripped away from the output. Optional blocks on the output require the use of the **AK** token."
