    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# MKDL: Load Key Distribution Token\n\nFuente: [MKDL: Load Key Distribution Token](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/keys/master_key_distribution/mkdl-load-key-distribution-token)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:07:45.740Z\n\n---\n\nThis command loads a key distribution token to a targeted device.\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| Master Key Distribution | Enables a host HSM to distribute allowed keys to another HSM. |\n\n<a id=\"required-permissions\"></a>\n\n## Required permissions\n\n| Permissions | Description | Port | Min Logins |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Major Keys:Distribution Import | Allows import of major keys using master key distribution commands | Mgmt | 1 |\n\n<a id=\"requirements\"></a>\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Remote key load chain of trust must have already been established using Excrypt command **MKDS**.\n- Key token generated by HSM acting as a KDH using Excrypt command **MKDG**.\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command ID | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `SJ` | Key token that was generated by the HSM acting as a KDH | Base64 | Variable | Yes |\n| `MK` | Major key to be loaded | Numeric | 1 | Yes |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Response ID | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `BB` | Loading success indicator | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `AE` | Exported key check value | Hexadecimal | 4-6 |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `MKDL` |\n\n<a id=\"sj-key-token-that-was-generated-by-the-hsm-acting-as-a-kdh\"></a>\n\n### SJ - Key token that was generated by the HSM acting as a KDH\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Base64 | A - Z, a - z, 0 - 9, “+”, ”/”, ”=“ |\n\n<a id=\"mk-major-key-to-be-loaded\"></a>\n\n### MK - Major key to be loaded\n\nThis must be consistent with the major key selected at the time of token generation.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `3`: Backup key (BAK)<br>`8`: Virtual master key (VMK) |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `MKDL` |\n\n<a id=\"bb-loading-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### BB - Loading success indicator\n\nIndicates whether or not the slot specified by the request token **MK**was loaded.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Slot loaded successfully<br>`N`: Slot not loaded |\n\n<a id=\"ae-exported-key-check-value\"></a>\n\n### AE - Exported key check value\n\nReturned upon success.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-6 | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n",
      "en": "# MKDL: Load Key Distribution Token\n\nFuente: [MKDL: Load Key Distribution Token](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/keys/master_key_distribution/mkdl-load-key-distribution-token)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:07:45.740Z\n\n---\n\nThis command loads a key distribution token to a targeted device.\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| Master Key Distribution | Enables a host HSM to distribute allowed keys to another HSM. |\n\n<a id=\"required-permissions\"></a>\n\n## Required permissions\n\n| Permissions | Description | Port | Min Logins |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Major Keys:Distribution Import | Allows import of major keys using master key distribution commands | Mgmt | 1 |\n\n<a id=\"requirements\"></a>\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Remote key load chain of trust must have already been established using Excrypt command **MKDS**.\n- Key token generated by HSM acting as a KDH using Excrypt command **MKDG**.\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command ID | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `SJ` | Key token that was generated by the HSM acting as a KDH | Base64 | Variable | Yes |\n| `MK` | Major key to be loaded | Numeric | 1 | Yes |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Response ID | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `BB` | Loading success indicator | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `AE` | Exported key check value | Hexadecimal | 4-6 |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `MKDL` |\n\n<a id=\"sj-key-token-that-was-generated-by-the-hsm-acting-as-a-kdh\"></a>\n\n### SJ - Key token that was generated by the HSM acting as a KDH\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Base64 | A - Z, a - z, 0 - 9, “+”, ”/”, ”=“ |\n\n<a id=\"mk-major-key-to-be-loaded\"></a>\n\n### MK - Major key to be loaded\n\nThis must be consistent with the major key selected at the time of token generation.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `3`: Backup key (BAK)<br>`8`: Virtual master key (VMK) |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `MKDL` |\n\n<a id=\"bb-loading-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### BB - Loading success indicator\n\nIndicates whether or not the slot specified by the request token **MK**was loaded.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Slot loaded successfully<br>`N`: Slot not loaded |\n\n<a id=\"ae-exported-key-check-value\"></a>\n\n### AE - Exported key check value\n\nReturned upon success.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-6 | Hexadecimal | 0 - 9, A - F |\n"
    }
