      "es": "This command is used to perform on-behalf key management export by using incoming data, encryption keys, and a generated MAC.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command expects that the data you send has the correct format as specified by the Mastercard OBKM (On Behalf Key Management) format. The data should include the file version at offset 0 and the MAC algorithm set to `3`.",
