    "summary": {
      "es": "This command decrypts a PGP-encrypted message.\n\nIf the message is short enough, you should send just one request, setting the **BJ** token to `0`.\n\nFor larger messages, you must send multiple messages.\n\n- For the first message, set the **BJ** token to `1`.\n- For the remaining messages, set the **BJ** token to `1` and insert the subsequent response `CH` token into the next request message. Repeat this process until you send the last request message.\n- In the last message, set the BJ token to `0`.\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Token **PW** cannot be used in PCI HSM mode.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode",
      "en": "This command decrypts a PGP-encrypted message.\n\nIf the message is short enough, you should send just one request, setting the **BJ** token to `0`.\n\nFor larger messages, you must send multiple messages.\n\n- For the first message, set the **BJ** token to `1`.\n- For the remaining messages, set the **BJ** token to `1` and insert the subsequent response `CH` token into the next request message. Repeat this process until you send the last request message.\n- In the last message, set the BJ token to `0`.\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Token **PW** cannot be used in PCI HSM mode.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode"
    },
