    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# PKCS: Calculate Check Digit of RSA Private Key\n\nFuente: [PKCS: Calculate Check Digit of RSA Private Key](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/keys/validate/pkcs-calculate-check-digit-of-rsa-private-key)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:07:55.872Z\n\n---\n\nThis command calculates the check digit, in CRC-32 format, of an RSA private key.\n\nEnabled in PCI HSM mode.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| RSA | Enables commands requiring RSA functionality. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `PKCS` |\n\n<a id=\"rc-rsa-private-key\"></a>\n\n### RC - RSA private key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4000 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-that-token-rc-is-under\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major Key that token RC is under\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK<br>`6`: PMK (default)<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `PKCS` |\n\n<a id=\"rc-check-digit-in-crc-32-format\"></a>\n\n### RC - Check digit in CRC-32 format\n\nValue calculated from the clear RSA DER key data.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 9 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command examples\n\n<a id=\"example-1\"></a>\n\n### Example 1\n\n```\nRequest: [AOPKCS;FS6;;]\n\nResponse: [AOPKCS;AE116054520;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-2\"></a>\n\n### Example 2\n\n```\nRequest: [AOPKCS;FS6;;]\n\nResponse: [AOPKCS;AE766117253;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nPMK Test Key: 8888888888888888 AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF 1111111111111111 Check Digit: (financial 1E26) (cmac 3B5E)\n",
      "en": "# PKCS: Calculate Check Digit of RSA Private Key\n\nFuente: [PKCS: Calculate Check Digit of RSA Private Key](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/keys/validate/pkcs-calculate-check-digit-of-rsa-private-key)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:07:55.872Z\n\n---\n\nThis command calculates the check digit, in CRC-32 format, of an RSA private key.\n\nEnabled in PCI HSM mode.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| RSA | Enables commands requiring RSA functionality. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `PKCS` |\n\n<a id=\"rc-rsa-private-key\"></a>\n\n### RC - RSA private key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4000 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-that-token-rc-is-under\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major Key that token RC is under\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK<br>`6`: PMK (default)<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `PKCS` |\n\n<a id=\"rc-check-digit-in-crc-32-format\"></a>\n\n### RC - Check digit in CRC-32 format\n\nValue calculated from the clear RSA DER key data.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 9 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command examples\n\n<a id=\"example-1\"></a>\n\n### Example 1\n\n```\nRequest: [AOPKCS;FS6;;]\n\nResponse: [AOPKCS;AE116054520;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"example-2\"></a>\n\n### Example 2\n\n```\nRequest: [AOPKCS;FS6;;]\n\nResponse: [AOPKCS;AE766117253;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nPMK Test Key: 8888888888888888 AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF 1111111111111111 Check Digit: (financial 1E26) (cmac 3B5E)\n"
    }
