    "summary": {
      "es": "This command uses a Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) CRYSTALS-Kyber public key to derive a symmetric key under the PMK from a given payload. It uses the NIST SP800-56A section 5.8.1 *Single Step key derivation* function for key derivation.\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval",
      "en": "This command uses a Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) CRYSTALS-Kyber public key to derive a symmetric key under the PMK from a given payload. It uses the NIST SP800-56A section 5.8.1 *Single Step key derivation* function for key derivation.\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval"
    },
