      "en": "RFDC performs a reset-to-factory-defaults (RFD) operation on the HSM. The command supports two modes: query mode (`FS0`) checks whether the HSM supports and is ready for an RFD, and commit mode (`FS1`) executes the reset. This operation clears all keys and configuration data from the device. The Device:Zeroize permission with dual-login control is required on the management port.\n\n> **Note:** - This command is only supported on the Vectera Plus and Excrypt SSP Enterprise v2.\n> - This command is not supported on the Excrypt Plus or virtual HSMs."
