    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# RSDD: RSA Data Decryption\n\nFuente: [RSDD: RSA Data Decryption](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/asymmetric/encrypt_decrypt/rsdd-rsa-data-decryption)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:09:07.393Z\n\n---\n\nThis command decrypts data that has been encrypted with an RSA public key.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| RSA | Enables commands requiring RSA functionality. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `RSDD` |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-of-input-cryptogram\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major Key of input cryptogram\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK (default)<br>`6`: PMK<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"rc-incoming-asymmetric-private-key\"></a>\n\n### RC - Incoming Asymmetric Private Key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"bo-incoming-encrypted-data\"></a>\n\n### BO - Incoming Encrypted Data\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"optional-at-padding\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) AT - Padding\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: PKCS Standard Padding (default)<br>`4`: OAEP Padding |\n\n<a id=\"optional-if-using-oaep-padding-op-hashing-algorithm-used-in-oaep\"></a>\n\n### (Optional, if using OAEP padding) OP - Hashing Algorithm used in OAEP\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: SHA-1<br>`4`: SHA-256 (default)<br>`5`: SHA-384<br>`6`: SHA-512<br>`7`: SHA-224 |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `RSDD` |\n\n<a id=\"bo-decrypted-output\"></a>\n\n### BO - Decrypted output\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command examples\n\n<a id=\"pkcs\"></a>\n\n### PKCS\n\n```\nRequest: [AORSDD;FS6;;AT1;BOB9BD4377FEB2C4273C6ABF1EC558A1E5A85040500513EAF5DF49CF96A85D370640D8F532BB48B8F4E3349F8B2F836DCE90561CD8B3FD69A75B06B68C20A4D26E568E86FE193EA935F087A777D1CED794EEA2D4E6D76EA0FB66148D6B2DC35905E99712CDD6C328767F3ACAA98CECE02ABFD83894380E84F3B86D1FC2154BB3A0;]\n\nResponse: [AORSDD;BOF5FFDBC68CDAB3C0BA32B2C8E7B851458FCB1FED7A6F88D3A27D0EAC9C9ACDCDD9D669CD7442BC5EC32B6C5DE5D71B4C8A23BF8759BEBDEBDD9A1F;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"oaep\"></a>\n\n### OAEP\n\n```\nRequest: [AORSDD;FS6;;AT4;BO85910C0168FA2AAF51B3052886EC88D4C18AA8F229D3727ABA44C6B42532DF697168715964130EE43B033EB637E3CC39D485775C5ADC7293D3221FF2102B2291E1E4326DD805ADAAF06D752FA40C6632EF6417F6E32CCF8AC26AC2A0603BF894E59B2CC86554E6885B2B93EA43BF62CDC234BD5F344C0E650C0DD2CF3EA3EA16;OP4;]\n\nResponse: [AORSDD;BO7E6F2CEA1D2A02A6A1ED5D27383D1B832FEB8C7E5871CCDAA8AD1B46CD75C8EC8B2E4FADC9CECA80D12B3BDB6FB573A6DF80FAE50511BBBEBAECD1;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"changelog\"></a>\n\n## Changelog\n\n2025-04-23\n\n- Added **FW-16027** | Added support for RSA 8192 keys.\n",
      "en": "# RSDD: RSA Data Decryption\n\nFuente: [RSDD: RSA Data Decryption](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/asymmetric/encrypt_decrypt/rsdd-rsa-data-decryption)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:09:07.393Z\n\n---\n\nThis command decrypts data that has been encrypted with an RSA public key.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| RSA | Enables commands requiring RSA functionality. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `RSDD` |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-of-input-cryptogram\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major Key of input cryptogram\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK (default)<br>`6`: PMK<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"rc-incoming-asymmetric-private-key\"></a>\n\n### RC - Incoming Asymmetric Private Key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"bo-incoming-encrypted-data\"></a>\n\n### BO - Incoming Encrypted Data\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"optional-at-padding\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) AT - Padding\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: PKCS Standard Padding (default)<br>`4`: OAEP Padding |\n\n<a id=\"optional-if-using-oaep-padding-op-hashing-algorithm-used-in-oaep\"></a>\n\n### (Optional, if using OAEP padding) OP - Hashing Algorithm used in OAEP\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: SHA-1<br>`4`: SHA-256 (default)<br>`5`: SHA-384<br>`6`: SHA-512<br>`7`: SHA-224 |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `RSDD` |\n\n<a id=\"bo-decrypted-output\"></a>\n\n### BO - Decrypted output\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command examples\n\n<a id=\"pkcs\"></a>\n\n### PKCS\n\n```\nRequest: [AORSDD;FS6;;AT1;BOB9BD4377FEB2C4273C6ABF1EC558A1E5A85040500513EAF5DF49CF96A85D370640D8F532BB48B8F4E3349F8B2F836DCE90561CD8B3FD69A75B06B68C20A4D26E568E86FE193EA935F087A777D1CED794EEA2D4E6D76EA0FB66148D6B2DC35905E99712CDD6C328767F3ACAA98CECE02ABFD83894380E84F3B86D1FC2154BB3A0;]\n\nResponse: [AORSDD;BOF5FFDBC68CDAB3C0BA32B2C8E7B851458FCB1FED7A6F88D3A27D0EAC9C9ACDCDD9D669CD7442BC5EC32B6C5DE5D71B4C8A23BF8759BEBDEBDD9A1F;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"oaep\"></a>\n\n### OAEP\n\n```\nRequest: [AORSDD;FS6;;AT4;BO85910C0168FA2AAF51B3052886EC88D4C18AA8F229D3727ABA44C6B42532DF697168715964130EE43B033EB637E3CC39D485775C5ADC7293D3221FF2102B2291E1E4326DD805ADAAF06D752FA40C6632EF6417F6E32CCF8AC26AC2A0603BF894E59B2CC86554E6885B2B93EA43BF62CDC234BD5F344C0E650C0DD2CF3EA3EA16;OP4;]\n\nResponse: [AORSDD;BO7E6F2CEA1D2A02A6A1ED5D27383D1B832FEB8C7E5871CCDAA8AD1B46CD75C8EC8B2E4FADC9CECA80D12B3BDB6FB573A6DF80FAE50511BBBEBAECD1;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"changelog\"></a>\n\n## Changelog\n\n2025-04-23\n\n- Added **FW-16027** | Added support for RSA 8192 keys.\n"
    }
