    "id": "futurex-tktw-req_677",
    "code": "TKTW",
    "direction": "request",
    "pairedCode": "TKTW",
    "name": {
      "es": "TKTW: firmware version 7.6.1.26 and older",
      "en": "TKTW: firmware version 7.6.1.26 and older"
    },
    "summary": {
      "es": "> **Note:** This is an older reference for the TKTW command, available in Firmware version 7.6.1.26 and older.\n\nThis command performs the following functions:\n\n- Translates cardholder data from under a DUKPT key to under another DUKPT key\n- Translates a PIN block from under a DUKPT key to under a PEK\n- Attempts to determine the format of a PAN\n- Returns an HMAC+PBKDF2 of the PAN\n- Returns a token of the PAN using FPE3.1\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval",
      "en": "> **Note:** This is an older reference for the TKTW command, available in Firmware version 7.6.1.26 and older.\n\nThis command performs the following functions:\n\n- Translates cardholder data from under a DUKPT key to under another DUKPT key\n- Translates a PIN block from under a DUKPT key to under a PEK\n- Attempts to determine the format of a PAN\n- Returns an HMAC+PBKDF2 of the PAN\n- Returns a token of the PAN using FPE3.1\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval"
    },
    "description": {
      "es": "> **Note:** This is an older reference for the TKTW command, available in Firmware version 7.6.1.26 and older.\n\nThis command performs the following functions:\n\n- Translates cardholder data from under a DUKPT key to under another DUKPT key\n- Translates a PIN block from under a DUKPT key to under a PEK\n- Attempts to determine the format of a PAN\n- Returns an HMAC+PBKDF2 of the PAN\n- Returns a token of the PAN using FPE3.1\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval",
      "en": "> **Note:** This is an older reference for the TKTW command, available in Firmware version 7.6.1.26 and older.\n\nThis command performs the following functions:\n\n- Translates cardholder data from under a DUKPT key to under another DUKPT key\n- Translates a PIN block from under a DUKPT key to under a PEK\n- Attempts to determine the format of a PAN\n- Returns an HMAC+PBKDF2 of the PAN\n- Returns a token of the PAN using FPE3.1\n\n> **Warning:** Disabled in PCI HSM Mode Pending PCI Approval"
    },
