      "es": "# TPKS: Calculate RSA Key Value\n\nFuente: [TPKS: Calculate RSA Key Value](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/keys/validate/tpks-calculate-rsa-key-value)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:10:03.167Z\n\n---\n\nThis command decrypts an encrypted Private Key with the provided cryptogram or key block and encrypts it under the MFK.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| RSA | Enables commands requiring RSA functionality. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command ID | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `AS` | Modifier for the cryptogram | Hexadecimal | 1-2 | Yes |\n| `BG` | Cryptogram of the working key encrypted under the specified modifier | Hexadecimal | Variable | Yes |\n| `RD` | Private key encrypted under working key | Hexadecimal | 1-4096 | Yes |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Response ID | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `RC` | Private Key encrypted under modifier 0 of the MFK | Hexadecimal | 1-4096 |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `TPKS` |\n\n<a id=\"as-modifier-for-the-cryptogram-see-appendix-key-modifiers\"></a>\n\n### AS - Modifier for the cryptogram (see Appendix Key Modifiers)\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-2 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"bg-cryptogram-of-the-working-key-encrypted-under-the-specified-modifier\"></a>\n\n### BG - Cryptogram of the working key encrypted under the specified modifier\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"rd-private-key-encrypted-under-working-key\"></a>\n\n### RD - Private key encrypted under working key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `TPKS` |\n\n<a id=\"rc-private-key-encrypted-under-modifier-0-of-the-mfk\"></a>\n\n### RC - Private Key encrypted under modifier 0 of the MFK\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command example\n\n```\nRequest: [AOTPKS;BGDEADBEEFDEADBEEFDEADBEEFDEADBEEFABCDABCDABCDABCD;;]\n\nResponse: [AOTPKS;;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nMFK Test Key: D2DE5CD9110F4CAB 1111111111111111 0123456789ABCDEF Check Digit: (financial 8071) (cmac 9652)\n",
      "en": "# TPKS: Calculate RSA Key Value\n\nFuente: [TPKS: Calculate RSA Key Value](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/keys/validate/tpks-calculate-rsa-key-value)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:10:03.167Z\n\n---\n\nThis command decrypts an encrypted Private Key with the provided cryptogram or key block and encrypts it under the MFK.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n<a id=\"required-licenses\"></a>\n\n## Required licenses\n\n| License Name | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| RSA | Enables commands requiring RSA functionality. |\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command ID | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `AS` | Modifier for the cryptogram | Hexadecimal | 1-2 | Yes |\n| `BG` | Cryptogram of the working key encrypted under the specified modifier | Hexadecimal | Variable | Yes |\n| `RD` | Private key encrypted under working key | Hexadecimal | 1-4096 | Yes |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Response ID | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `RC` | Private Key encrypted under modifier 0 of the MFK | Hexadecimal | 1-4096 |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `TPKS` |\n\n<a id=\"as-modifier-for-the-cryptogram-see-appendix-key-modifiers\"></a>\n\n### AS - Modifier for the cryptogram (see Appendix Key Modifiers)\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-2 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"bg-cryptogram-of-the-working-key-encrypted-under-the-specified-modifier\"></a>\n\n### BG - Cryptogram of the working key encrypted under the specified modifier\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Variable | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"rd-private-key-encrypted-under-working-key\"></a>\n\n### RD - Private key encrypted under working key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `TPKS` |\n\n<a id=\"rc-private-key-encrypted-under-modifier-0-of-the-mfk\"></a>\n\n### RC - Private Key encrypted under modifier 0 of the MFK\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command example\n\n```\nRequest: [AOTPKS;BGDEADBEEFDEADBEEFDEADBEEFDEADBEEFABCDABCDABCDABCD;;]\n\nResponse: [AOTPKS;;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nMFK Test Key: D2DE5CD9110F4CAB 1111111111111111 0123456789ABCDEF Check Digit: (financial 8071) (cmac 9652)\n"
