      "en": "This command translates an encrypted working key, by using no modifier of the key encryption key (KEK), to a key encrypted under the specified modifier of the Major Key.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- Typically, when using this function, you receive a working key from an HSM that does not support modifiers, and you need to translate the key for use by a Futurex HSM that does support modifiers."
