    "summary": {
      "es": "This command validates a card verification value using the Multibanco algorithm.\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS Mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- The CVV key is encrypted under a different modifier when you enable *Use Compatibility Modifier For CVC/CVV Generation/Verification*setting. For more information, see the **CVC compatibility code** resource.\n- In Firmware version 7.6.1.23 and later CVC/CVV AKB headers 1CD**000 can be used regardless of how the *Use Compatibility Modifier For CVC/CVV Generation/Verification* setting is set",
      "en": "This command validates a card verification value using the Multibanco algorithm.\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS Mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- The CVV key is encrypted under a different modifier when you enable *Use Compatibility Modifier For CVC/CVV Generation/Verification*setting. For more information, see the **CVC compatibility code** resource.\n- In Firmware version 7.6.1.23 and later CVC/CVV AKB headers 1CD**000 can be used regardless of how the *Use Compatibility Modifier For CVC/CVV Generation/Verification* setting is set"
    },
