      "es": "# VCVV: Verify CVV/CVC Value\n\nFuente: [VCVV: Verify CVV/CVC Value](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/payments_cards/card_verification/vcvv-verify-cvvcvc-value)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:10:57.933Z\n\n---\n\nThis command verifies Visa Card Verification Value (CVV) and MasterCard Card Verification Code (CVC) values.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS Mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- The cryptogram is encrypted under a different modifier when using CVC Compatibility Mode. For more information, see the **CVC compatibility code** resource.\n- In Firmware version 7.6.1.23 and later CVC/CVV AKB headers 1CD**000 can be used regardless of how the *Use Compatibility Modifier For CVC/CVV Generation/Verification* setting is set.\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\nResponse tokens\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `VCVV` |\n\n<a id=\"av-pan-digits-account-number\"></a>\n\n### AV - PAN digits (account number)\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4-19 | Numeric | 0 - 9 |\n\n<a id=\"ca-left-half-or-full-cvv-key-a\"></a>\n\n### CA - Left Half or Full CVV Key A\n\nThis field supports the following:\n\n- Cryptogram encrypted under modifier 4 of the MFK\n- AKB  \n\n  - 1CDNE000, 1CDNN000\n  - 1CDVE000, 1CDVN000\n- TR-31 key block  \n\n  - **Key Usage**: C0 (preferred), V0 (legacy)\n  - **Algorithm**: T, D\n  - **Mode of use**: C\n- Key Storage Table index\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16<br>32<br>48 | Hexadecimal | **Cryptogram**<br>0 - 9, A - F |\n| 74<br>88+ | ASCII | **Key block**<br>A - Z, a - z, 0 - 9 except ; [ ] |\n| 3-7 | Alphanumeric | BD + key slot number |\n\n<a id=\"cb-mastercard-card-verification-key-b-cvk\"></a>\n\n### CB - Mastercard Card Verification Key B (CVK)\n\nThis field supports the following:\n\n- Cryptogram encrypted under modifier 4 of the MFK\n- AKB  \n\n  - 1CDNE000, 1CDNN000\n  - 1CDVE000, 1CDVN000\n- TR-31 key block  \n\n  - **Key Usage**: C0 (preferred), V0 (legacy)\n  - **Algorithm**: D\n  - **Mode of use**: C\n- Key Storage Table index\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 16<br>32<br>48 | Hexadecimal | **Cryptogram**<br>0 - 9, A - F |\n| 74<br>88+ | ASCII | **Key block**<br>A - Z, a - z, 0 - 9 except ; [ ] |\n| 3-7 | Alphanumeric | BD + key slot number |\n\n<a id=\"fa-expiration-date\"></a>\n\n### FA - Expiration date\n\n**Format**: YYMM\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Numeric | 0 - 9 |\n\n<a id=\"fb-service-code\"></a>\n\n### FB - Service code\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 | Numeric | `000`: Invalid<br>001 - 999: Valid |\n\n<a id=\"fc-cvv-taken-from-the-card’s-magnetic-stripe-track-2\"></a>\n\n### FC - CVV taken from the card’s magnetic stripe track 2\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 | Numeric | 0 - 9 |\n\n<a id=\"optional-ft-cvv2-embossed-on-the-card\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FT - CVV2 embossed on the card\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 | Numeric | 0 - 9 |\n\n<a id=\"optional-re-modified-cvv2-generation-to-not-flip-the-mmyy-in-the-calculation\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) RE - Modified CVV2 Generation to not flip the MMYY in the calculation\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `0`: Flip YYMM (default)<br>`1`: Do not flip |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `VCVV` |\n\n<a id=\"bb-verification-result\"></a>\n\n### BB - Verification result\n\nThis is only returned if the CVV (request token **FC**) is sent or both CVV (request token **FC**) and CVV2 (request token **FT**) are sent.\n\n**Note**Response token **CT**returns the verifications for the CVV and CVV2.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Verified<br>`N`: Not verified |\n\n<a id=\"ct-individual-verification-confirmation-for-cvv-and-cvv2\"></a>\n\n### CT - Individual verification confirmation for CVV and CVV2\n\nOnly returned if both CVV (request token **FC**) and CVV2 (request token **FT**) are sent.\n\nThe verification values are CVV first and CVV2 second.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Verified<br>`N`: Not verified |\n\n<a id=\"re-cvv2-generation-modification-confirmation\"></a>\n\n### RE - CVV2 generation modification confirmation\n\nOnly returned if request token **RE**is `1`.\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `Y`: Verified<br>`N`: Not verified |\n\n<a id=\"command-examples\"></a>\n\n## Command examples\n\n<a id=\"cvv\"></a>\n\n### **CVV**\n\n```\nRequest: [AOVCVV;AV6543210000001234;CAC6CA6CCD5C517A0F;CB74005058B808F6DB;FA1505;FB101;FC450;]\n\nResponse: [AOVCVV;BBY;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"cvv-and-cvv2\"></a>\n\n### CVV and CVV2\n\n```\nRequest: [AOVCVV;AV6543210000001234;CAC6CA6CCD5C517A0F;CB74005058B808F6DB;FA1505;FB101;FC450;FT004;]\n\nResponse: [AOVCVV;BBY;CTYY;]\n```\n\n**CVV2 failed to verification**\n\n```\nRequest: [AOVCVV;AV6543210000001234;CAC6CA6CCD5C517A0F;CB74005058B808F6DB;FA1505;FB101;FC450;FT111;]\n\nResponse: [AOVCVV;BBN;CTYN;]\n```\n\n**CVV2 modified**\n\n```\nRequest: [AOVCVC;AV6543210000001234;CAC6CA6CCD5C517A0F;CB74005058B808F6DB;FA0515;FB101;FC177;FT004;RE1;]\n\nResponse: [AOVCVC;BBY;CTYY;RE1;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nMFK Test Key: D2DE5CD9110F4CAB 1111111111111111 0123456789ABCDEF Check Digit: (financial 8071) (cmac 9652)\n\n<a id=\"changelog\"></a>\n\n## Changelog\n\n2025-07-23\n\n- Updated **FW-14992** | Allow the use of CVC/CVV AKB headers `1CD**000`, regardless of how the Use Compatibility Modifier For CVC/CVV Generation/Verification setting is set.\n\n2024-11-27\n\n- Updated **FW-15420** | Updated TR-31 key blocks to allow C0 key usage.\n",
