    "id": "futurex-vmap-req",
    "code": "VMAP",
    "direction": "request",
    "pairedCode": "VMAP",
    "name": {
      "es": "VMAP: Verify MAC and PIN",
      "en": "VMAP: Verify MAC and PIN"
    },
    "summary": {
      "es": "This command combines the functions provided by the **VMAC** and **VPIN** commands. This command attempts to verify the MAC first. If the MAC fails verification, there is no point in continuing because the message might not be authentic. For that reason, Excrypt does not attempt to verify the PIN if it cannot verify the MAC.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command has the following variations:  \n\n  - **IBM 3624**: Verifies both the message and PIN by IBM 3624 method.\n  - **Visa**: Verifies both the message and PIN by Visa method.\n  - **Diebold**: Verifies both the message and PIN by Diebold method.",
      "en": "This command combines the functions provided by the **VMAC** and **VPIN** commands. This command attempts to verify the MAC first. If the MAC fails verification, there is no point in continuing because the message might not be authentic. For that reason, Excrypt does not attempt to verify the PIN if it cannot verify the MAC.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command has the following variations:  \n\n  - **IBM 3624**: Verifies both the message and PIN by IBM 3624 method.\n  - **Visa**: Verifies both the message and PIN by Visa method.\n  - **Diebold**: Verifies both the message and PIN by Diebold method."
    },
    "description": {
      "es": "This command combines the functions provided by the **VMAC** and **VPIN** commands. This command attempts to verify the MAC first. If the MAC fails verification, there is no point in continuing because the message might not be authentic. For that reason, Excrypt does not attempt to verify the PIN if it cannot verify the MAC.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command has the following variations:  \n\n  - **IBM 3624**: Verifies both the message and PIN by IBM 3624 method.\n  - **Visa**: Verifies both the message and PIN by Visa method.\n  - **Diebold**: Verifies both the message and PIN by Diebold method.",
      "en": "This command combines the functions provided by the **VMAC** and **VPIN** commands. This command attempts to verify the MAC first. If the MAC fails verification, there is no point in continuing because the message might not be authentic. For that reason, Excrypt does not attempt to verify the PIN if it cannot verify the MAC.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- This command has the following variations:  \n\n  - **IBM 3624**: Verifies both the message and PIN by IBM 3624 method.\n  - **Visa**: Verifies both the message and PIN by Visa method.\n  - **Diebold**: Verifies both the message and PIN by Diebold method."
    },
