      "en": "This command verifies a PIN using a defined method.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in PCI HSM mode when Clear PIN license is enabled.\n\n> **Danger:** Disabled in FIPS mode\n\n**Notes**\n\n- The tokens included in the command depend on the PIN verification method and input PIN block format chosen. All requests include tokens **AO**, **BF**, and **AW**. Following those three tokens, the request varies according to which tokens are available for the chosen method and format.\n- You should pick one PIN verification method and one PIN block method, as defined in this document."
