      "es": "# WINS: Windows Portable Executable Signing\n\nFuente: [WINS: Windows Portable Executable Signing](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/signatures_macs/sign/wins-windows-portable-executable-signing)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:11:54.011Z\n\n---\n\nThis command creates a signature for a Windows Portable Executable file.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command ID | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `FS` | Major key for token RC | Numeric | 1 | Optional |\n| `RC` | Signing Key | Hexadecimal | 2-4096 | Yes |\n| `CE` | Signing Certificate (X.509 or PKCS #7) | Hexadecimal | 2-4096 | Yes |\n| `CF` | CA Certificates to embed (X.509 or PKCS #7) | Hexadecimal | 2-8196 | Yes |\n| `RF` | Hash of Portable Executable | Hexadecimal | 2-256 | Yes |\n| `RG` | Algorithm used to generate hash and for signing | Numeric | 1 | Yes |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Response ID | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `BB` | Success Indicator | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `BO` | PKCS #7 Signature | Hexadecimal | 2-8196 |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `WINS` |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-for-token-rc\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major key for token RC\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK<br>`6`: PMK (default)<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"rc-signing-key\"></a>\n\n### RC - Signing Key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"ce-signing-certificate-x-509-or-pkcs-#7\"></a>\n\n### CE - Signing Certificate (X.509 or PKCS #7)\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"cf-ca-certificates-to-embed-x-509-or-pkcs-#7\"></a>\n\n### CF - CA Certificates to embed (X.509 or PKCS #7)\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-8196 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"rf-hash-of-portable-executable\"></a>\n\n### RF - Hash of Portable Executable\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-256 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"rg-algorithm-used-to-generate-hash-and-for-signing\"></a>\n\n### RG - Algorithm used to generate hash and for signing\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: SHA-1<br>`2`: MD5<br>`3`: RIPE-MD160<br>`4`: SHA-256<br>`5`: SHA-384<br>`6`: SHA-512<br>`7`: SHA-224 |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `WINS` |\n\n<a id=\"bb-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### BB - Success Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Success<br>`N`: Failure |\n\n<a id=\"bo-pkcs-#7-signature\"></a>\n\n### BO - PKCS #7 Signature\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-8196 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command Example\n\n```\nRequest: [AOWINS;FS1;;;;RF53A2A321F9DEAB5034361733D5096D7EE55534D4;RG1;ST28;]\n\nResponse: [AOWINS;BBY;;SR28;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nMFK Test Key: D2DE5CD9110F4CAB 1111111111111111 0123456789ABCDEF Check Digit: (financial 8071) (cmac 9652)\n",
      "en": "# WINS: Windows Portable Executable Signing\n\nFuente: [WINS: Windows Portable Executable Signing](https://docs.futurex.com/HSM_Commands/7.6.1.x/Excrypt_commands/signatures_macs/sign/wins-windows-portable-executable-signing)  \nVersión del catálogo: **7.6.1.x**  \nCapturado: 2026-10-01T08:11:54.011Z\n\n---\n\nThis command creates a signature for a Windows Portable Executable file.\n\n> **Check:** Enabled in PCI HSM mode\n\n<a id=\"token-summary\"></a>\n\n## Token summary\n\nAt-a-glance request and response tokens for this command. For accepted values, conditional rules, and usage notes, see the detailed token sections below.\n\nRequest tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length | Required |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command ID | Alphabetic | 4 | Yes |\n| `FS` | Major key for token RC | Numeric | 1 | Optional |\n| `RC` | Signing Key | Hexadecimal | 2-4096 | Yes |\n| `CE` | Signing Certificate (X.509 or PKCS #7) | Hexadecimal | 2-4096 | Yes |\n| `CF` | CA Certificates to embed (X.509 or PKCS #7) | Hexadecimal | 2-8196 | Yes |\n| `RF` | Hash of Portable Executable | Hexadecimal | 2-256 | Yes |\n| `RG` | Algorithm used to generate hash and for signing | Numeric | 1 | Yes |\n\nResponse tokens\n\n| Token | Parameter | Type | Length |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `AO` | Command Response ID | Alphabetic | 4 |\n| `BB` | Success Indicator | Alphabetic | 1 |\n| `BO` | PKCS #7 Signature | Hexadecimal | 2-8196 |\n\n<a id=\"request-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Request tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `WINS` |\n\n<a id=\"optional-fs-major-key-for-token-rc\"></a>\n\n### (Optional) FS - Major key for token RC\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: MFK<br>`6`: PMK (default)<br>`7`: FTK (if PKCS11 is available) |\n\n<a id=\"rc-signing-key\"></a>\n\n### RC - Signing Key\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"ce-signing-certificate-x-509-or-pkcs-#7\"></a>\n\n### CE - Signing Certificate (X.509 or PKCS #7)\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-4096 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"cf-ca-certificates-to-embed-x-509-or-pkcs-#7\"></a>\n\n### CF - CA Certificates to embed (X.509 or PKCS #7)\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-8196 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"rf-hash-of-portable-executable\"></a>\n\n### RF - Hash of Portable Executable\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-256 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"rg-algorithm-used-to-generate-hash-and-for-signing\"></a>\n\n### RG - Algorithm used to generate hash and for signing\n\n| Length | Data Type | Accepted Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Numeric | `1`: SHA-1<br>`2`: MD5<br>`3`: RIPE-MD160<br>`4`: SHA-256<br>`5`: SHA-384<br>`6`: SHA-512<br>`7`: SHA-224 |\n\n<a id=\"response-tokens\"></a>\n\n## Response tokens\n\n<a id=\"ao-command-response-id\"></a>\n\n### AO - Command Response ID\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 | Alphabetic | `WINS` |\n\n<a id=\"bb-success-indicator\"></a>\n\n### BB - Success Indicator\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Alphabetic | `Y`: Success<br>`N`: Failure |\n\n<a id=\"bo-pkcs-#7-signature\"></a>\n\n### BO - PKCS #7 Signature\n\n| Length | Data Type | Returned Values |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2-8196 | Hexadecimal | 0-9, A-F |\n\n<a id=\"command-example\"></a>\n\n## Command Example\n\n```\nRequest: [AOWINS;FS1;;;;RF53A2A321F9DEAB5034361733D5096D7EE55534D4;RG1;ST28;]\n\nResponse: [AOWINS;BBY;;SR28;]\n```\n\n<a id=\"test-key-used\"></a>\n\n### Test Key Used\n\nMFK Test Key: D2DE5CD9110F4CAB 1111111111111111 0123456789ABCDEF Check Digit: (financial 8071) (cmac 9652)\n"
